WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:08.360
Cora quickly explained her plan.

2
00:00:08.361 --> 00:00:11.735
"I don't know," Mo said.

3
00:00:11.736 --> 00:00:15.278
"We can do it, Mo!" Cora said.

4
00:00:15.279 --> 00:00:18.684
"We have to save Sal."

5
00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.556
Mo bit his lip.

6
00:00:20.557 --> 00:00:23.530
"It's too dangerous for Sasha."

7
00:00:23.531 --> 00:00:27.656
"I'll have to swim fast," Sasha said.

8
00:00:27.657 --> 00:00:32.810
"But there's a shrimp trick I can try."

9
00:00:32.811 --> 00:00:37.288
"Let's do it!" Cora said.

10
00:00:37.289 --> 00:00:41.759
Sasha swam down to the crab.

11
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:45.690
"Hey, hungry crab!" she called.

12
00:00:45.691 --> 00:00:48.280
"Do you like shrimp?"

13
00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:53.311
"Yes!" The crab darted toward Sasha.

14
00:00:53.312 --> 00:00:58.811
"You can't catch me!" Sasha said.

15
00:00:58.812 --> 00:01:02.701
"Yes, I can!" The crab snapped his claws.

16
00:01:02.702 --> 00:01:05.145
Then he flew after her.

17
00:01:05.146 --> 00:01:08.759
Sasha darted away—backward!

18
00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:11.017
She shot through the water.

19
00:01:11.018 --> 00:01:14.294
The crab chased her fast.

20
00:01:14.295 --> 00:01:17.037
He moved closer and closer.

21
00:01:17.038 --> 00:01:20.834
He shot out his big claw. Snap!

22
00:01:20.835 --> 00:01:22.821
"Got you!"

23
00:01:22.822 --> 00:01:28.795
Something grabbed him from behind! "Ahh!"

24
00:01:28.796 --> 00:01:31.367
It was Cora!

25
00:01:31.368 --> 00:01:36.874
"Go, Mo and Sasha!" Cora said.

26
00:01:36.875 --> 00:01:40.706
They shot through the crack into the shipwreck.

27
00:01:40.707 --> 00:01:45.320
Inside it was dark and murky.

28
00:01:45.321 --> 00:01:49.660
Mo gulped. "Where's Sal?"

29
00:01:49.661 --> 00:01:53.136
"Sal?" Sasha called.

30
00:01:53.137 --> 00:01:56.643
Suddenly Mo saw something in the water.

31
00:01:56.644 --> 00:02:01.931
It was the arrow—pointing to Sal!

